WEBVTT

00:00:58.379 --> 00:01:01.029
and the first AD calls out "Rolling!"

00:01:01.053 --> 00:01:03.434
And then I hear "speed," "marker," "set,"

00:01:03.458 --> 00:01:06.029
and then the director calls "Action!"

00:01:06.053 --> 00:01:08.057
I've heard that sequence so many times,

00:01:08.081 --> 00:01:11.711
like, it's become this Pavlovian
magic spell for me.

00:01:11.735 --> 00:01:15.353
"Rolling," "speed," "marker,"
"set" and "action."

00:01:15.377 --> 00:01:18.131
Something happens to me,
I can't even help it.

00:01:18.465 --> 00:01:20.152
My attention ...

00:01:21.389 --> 00:01:22.548
narrows.

00:01:22.572 --> 00:01:24.540
And everything else in the world,

00:01:24.564 --> 00:01:30.337
anything else that might be bothering me
or might grab my attention,